    {
      "id": "p0246-b003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "It turns out that Torie! and Asgore once had a kindhearted child named Asriel. But through a series of tragic events, Asriel was transformed into the wrathful Flowey. Now, near the end of the game, Asriel gains immense, godlike power - enough for him to destroy everything and everyone for good.",
        "raw": "It turns out that Torie! and Asgore once had a kindhearted child named Asriel.\nBut through a series of tragic events, Asriel was transformed into the wrathful\nFlowey. Now, near the end of the game, Asriel gains immense, godlike power -\nenough for him to destroy everything and everyone for good.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.29195196,
          0.22303571,
          0.89371011,
          0.28943571
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.28905943,
          0.22232143,
          0.90517838,
          0.29050714
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          8,
          9,
          10,
          11
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "原来，Toriel 和 Asgore 曾有个心地善良的孩子，名叫 Asriel。一连串悲剧却把他变成了满怀怨恨的 Flowey。如今游戏将近结尾，Asriel 获得了近乎神明的强大力量，足以彻底摧毁一切。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
      },
