    {
      "id": "p0246-b004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "As Asgore's son, Asriel's full name is \"Asriel Dreemur\". Keen-eyed players have noticed that \"Asriel Dreemur\" is an anagram of\"Serial Murderer\", and Toby has confirmed that this was intentional:",
        "raw": "As Asgore's son, Asriel's full name is \"Asriel Dreemur\". Keen-eyed players have\nnoticed that \"Asriel Dreemur\" is an anagram of\"Serial Murderer\", and Toby\nhas confirmed that this was intentional:",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.29109642,
          0.30489286,
          0.89698967,
          0.35445
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.28905943,
          0.30417857,
          0.90517838,
          0.35552143
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          12,
          13,
          14
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "作为 Asgore 的儿子，Asriel 全名是“Asriel Dreemurr”。细心的玩家发现，把这些字母重新排列，就会得到“Serial Murderer”（连环杀人犯）。Toby 也确认，这是刻意设计的：",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
      },
