    {
      "id": "p0246-b006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "To preserve this hidden aspect of Asriel’s character, the localization team considered giving Asriel a new Japanese name with a similarly frightening anagram. Thus, in early drafts of the Japanese script, Asriel Dreemur was named アシリル・ラーキ (Ashiriru Rāki, roughly \"Aseril Lerki\"), which could be rearranged to spell シリアル・キラー (shiriaru kirā, \"serial killer\").",
        "raw": "To preserve this hidden aspect of Asriel's character, the localization team\nconsidered giving Asriel a new Japanese name with a similarly frightening\nanagram. Thus, in early drafts of the Japanese script, Asriel Dreemur was\nnamed\nJv· 7-:\\'-(Ashiriru Riiki, roughly \"Aseril Lerki\"), which could be\n7~1)\nrearranged to\n7 Jv · :¥-7- (shiriaru kirii, \"serial killer\").\nspell~ 1)",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en",
          "ja"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.29289916,
          0.46022857,
          0.89235551,
          0.54602143
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.28905943,
          0.45951429,
          0.90517838,
          0.54709286
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          22,
          23,
          24,
          25,
          26,
          27,
          28,
          29,
          30
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "为了保留 Asriel 隐藏的这一面，团队曾考虑替他另取一个日文名字，同样暗藏骇人的重排结果。因此，日文早期草稿曾用「アシリル・ラーキ」（Ashiriru Rāki，约相当于“Aseril Lerki”），可以重排成「シリアル・キラー」（shiriaru kirā，连环杀手）。",
