    {
      "id": "p0246-b009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Of course, this localization choice had downsides too: players in Japan would know this important character by a very different last name, and the name Riiki doesn't evoke the same whimsical feeling that \"Dreemur\" does. More importantly, however, Toby chose the name \"Asriel\" with two other special meanings in mind:",
        "raw": "Of course, this localization choice had downsides too: players in Japan would\nknow this important character by a very different last name, and the name\nRiiki doesn't evoke the same whimsical feeling that \"Dreemur\" does. More\nimportantly, however, Toby chose the name \"Asriel\" with two other special\nmeanings in mind:",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.29317415,
          0.69741429,
          0.88647879,
          0.78302143
